mt-[25px] max-[840px]:hidden"></div></aside></div><section class="mt-5 bg-black/50 flex flex-[1_0_auto]"><div class="flex-[1_0_300px] max-[1200px]:hidden flex items-start justify-center pt-5"><div id="image-top-side" class="w-[300px]"></div></div><div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-5 pt-5 pb-20 w-full leading-[1.5em]"><h2>Simple and fast image sharing</h2><p class="max-w-[600px] mx-auto">Pasteboard is the best way to share your screenshots and images online. <br/> It supports images of the formats JPEG, PNG, GIF, APNG and TIFF up to 5MB.</p><div class="mt-[60px]"><h2>Features</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-4 max-[1200px]:grid-cols-1"><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Copy &amp; Paste" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fclipboard.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fclipboard.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fclipboard.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Copy &amp; Paste</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Insert images directly from your clipboard.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Drag &amp; Drop" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fdrag.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fdrag.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fdrag.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Drag &amp; Drop</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Drag and drop files from your computer.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Mobile" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fmobile.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fmobile.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fmobile.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Mobile</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Upload from your stored photos or capture a new one without leaving the website.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Webcam" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fwebcam.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fwebcam.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fwebcam.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Webcam</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Snap a picture using your webcam.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Cropping" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fcrop.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fcrop.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fcrop.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Cropping</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Use the built-in tools to crop a portion of the image. The rest is never uploaded.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center text-left p-[10px]"><img alt="Anonymous" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 mr-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fanonymous.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fanonymous.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffeatures%2Fanonymous.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div><h3 class="m-0 text-left">Anonymous</h3><p class="mt-[5px] mb-0">Decide who you share your images with. Uploads are never discoverable by themselves.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 flex justify-center"><a class="btn btn-confirm" href="/">Upload an image</a></div></div><div class="flex-[1_0_300px] max-[1200px]:hidden flex items-start justify-center pt-5"><div id="image-bottom-side" class="w-[300px]"></div></div></section><footer class="flex justify-center items-center w-full bg-black/50 py-3 px-5 text-[#9296a0] text-[0.9em]"><div class="text-[13px]"><a class="text-[#9296a0] hover:text-white/75 transition-colors duration-200" href="/premium">Premium</a><span class="mx-1">·</span><a class="text-[#9296a0] hover:text-white/75 transition-colors duration-200" href="/advertise">Advertise</a><span class="mx-1">·</span><a class="text-[#9296a0] hover:text-white/75 transition-colors duration-200" href="/contact">Contact</a><span class="mx-1">·</span><a class="text-[#9296a0] hover:text-white/75 transition-colors duration-200" href="/terms">Terms &amp; Policy</a></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2eb758dea75faf50.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[1402,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"914\",\"static/chunks/914-55d34ddf82019374.js\",\"347\",\"static/chunks/347-e930addc7219ab9e.js\",\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-d25028f51b5dd18e.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[4592,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"914\",\"static/chunks/914-55d34ddf82019374.js\",\"347\",\"static/chunks/347-e930addc7219ab9e.js\",\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-d25028f51b5dd18e.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[9305,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"914\",\"static/chunks/914-55d34ddf82019374.js\",\"347\",\"static/chunks/347-e930addc7219ab9e.js\",\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-d25028f51b5dd18e.js\"],\"TRPCProvider\"]\n5:I[6840,[\"619\",\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\",\"914\",\"static/chunks/91